   "Each event has 2+ options, exactly one historical option, and unique option ids.",
   "narrative_only events offer no option with a positive stat or prestige payoff to the perpetrator.",
   "Mandatory prerequisite graph (requires / event conditions in triggers) has no cycles (Tarjan SCC).",
   "Earliest possible date propagated through prerequisites never exceeds an event's latest date (no impossible triggers).",
   "Mutually exclusive events are never both mandatory prerequisites of a third event.",
   "Entities referenced in a trigger exist at the event's date or are created by a reachable earlier event.",
   "Flags read by triggers are set by some effect or declared as system flags.",
